    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d230">

                <pb facs="0243" n="231" sameAs="frus:frus1943v05/pg231"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">815.24/820</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Honduras</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Erwin</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 2785</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Tegucigalpa</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1943-03-11">March 11, 1943</date>.<lb/>[Received March
                        16.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to refer to the
                    Department’s circular airgrams of January 19, 1943, 8:00 p.m.,<anchor n="54"
                        xml:id="d230-f1"/> January 30, 1943, 3:10 p.m., and February 19, 1943, 7:50
                        p.m.,<anchor n="55" xml:id="d230-f2"/> and to report that Decentralization
                    Plan A<anchor n="56" xml:id="d230-f3"/> is to become effective in Honduras April
                    1, 1943.</p>
                <p>This Legation has just been informed that the Department has suggested that Plan
                    A be not started in El Salvador until April 1, in <pb facs="0244" n="232"
                        xml:id="pg232"/> lieu of the original starting date of March 1, in order
                    that there be opportunity to accumulate and forward needed data.</p>
                <p>The Legation requests an instruction as to whether the starting date of April 1
                    in Honduras is approved by the Department or whether some later date should be
                        selected.<anchor n="57" xml:id="d230-f4"/></p>
                <p>Respectfully yours,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">John D. Erwin</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d230-f1" n="54" xml:id="d230-f1-content">
                <p><hi rendition="#italic">Ante</hi>, <ref target="#pg106">p. 106</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d230-f2" n="55" xml:id="d230-f2-content">
                <p>Neither printed.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d230-f3" n="56" xml:id="d230-f3-content">
                <p>For an outline of the plan, see circular airgram of January 19, 8 p.m., <ref
                        target="#pg106">p. 106</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d230-f4" n="57" xml:id="d230-f4-content">
                <p>This date appeared to be satisfactory.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
